        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// v4.0: Prepare AI Payload for clause extraction\nconst text = $json.extracted_text || '';\nconst precalc = $('Pre-calc Params').first().json;\n\nconsole.log(`[Prepare AI Payload] Text length: ${text.length} chars`);\n\nif (!text || text.length < 100) {\n  throw new Error(`Extracted text too short (${text.length} chars) - extraction failed`);\n}\n\nconst aiPayload = {\n  model: 'gpt-4o',\n  temperature: 0,\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: 'system',\n      content: `You are a legal document parser. Extract ALL numbered or titled clauses/sections from the contract.\n\nIMPORTANT: Return a JSON object with this EXACT structure:\n{\n  \"clauses\": [\n    {\n      \"clause_id\": \"clause_1\",\n      \"heading\": \"SECTION TITLE OR CLAUSE NUMBER\",\n      \"clause_text\": \"Full text of the clause...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract EVERY distinct clause/section you can identify\n- Include numbered sections (1., 2., etc.) and titled sections\n- Preserve the full text of each clause\n- The \"clauses\" array MUST contain at least one item`\n    },\n    {\n      role: 'user',\n      content: text.substring(0, 100000)\n    }\n  ],\n  response_format: { type: 'json_object' }\n};\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...precalc,\n    ai_payload: aiPayload,\n    extracted_text: text,\n    extraction_method: $json.extraction_method || 'unknown'\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "id": "prepare_ai_payload",
            "name": "Prepare AI Payload",
